/rp></ruby>はファンの<ruby>群<rp>(</rp><rt>むら</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>がる<ruby>中<rp>(</rp><rt>なか</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>を<ruby>苦心<rp>(</rp><rt>くしん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>して<ruby>進<rp>(</rp><rt>すす</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>んだ。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">歌手在球迷的人群中奋力奋斗</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">苦情</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">くじょう</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n2\" href=\"../../n2/vocab/\">N2</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">抱怨；麻烦；异议；怨言</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"161697\"><ruby>私<rp>(</rp><rt>わたし</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>はあなたの<ruby>苦情<rp>(</rp><rt>くじょう</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>について<ruby>書<rp>(</rp><rt>か</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>いている。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">我写你的投诉。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">薬指</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">くすりゆび</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n2\" href=\"../../n2/vocab/\">N2</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">无名指（尤指钢琴演奏中的第四指）；第四趾</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"89957\"><ruby>彼女<rp>(</rp><rt>かのじょ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>は<ruby>左手<rp>(</rp><rt>ひだりて</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>の<ruby>薬指<rp>(</rp><rt>くすりゆび</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>にダイヤの<ruby>指輪<rp>(</rp><rt>ゆびわ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>をはめていた。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">她左三指上戴着钻石戒指</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">屑</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">くず</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n2\" href=\"../../n2/vocab/\">N2</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">废料；废品；垃圾；