></span><span class=\"v-m\">累；疲倦；疲惫；用旧；磨损；破损；厌烦（做）；厌倦（做）；受够（了）</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"156638\"><ruby>私<rp>(</rp><rt>わたし</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>は<ruby>仕事<rp>(</rp><rt>しごと</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>でひどくくたびれている。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">我工作很累,我有点累了</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">砕く</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">くだく</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n2\" href=\"../../n2/vocab/\">N2</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">动词Ⅰ</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">動詞Ⅰ</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">打碎；粉碎；压碎；研磨；捣碎；摧毁（希望、信心等）；使破灭；挫败；简化；使通俗易懂</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"197583\">ピックは<ruby>硬<rp>(</rp><rt>かた</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>い<ruby>地表<rp>(</rp><rt>ちひょう</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>を<ruby>砕<rp>(</rp><rt>くだ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>くために<ruby>用<rp>(</rp><rt>もち</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>いられる<ruby>長<rp>(</rp><rt>なが</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>い<ruby>取<rp>(</rp><rt>と</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>っ<ruby>手<rp>(</rp><rt>て</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>の<ruby>道具<rp>(</rp><rt>どうぐ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>だ。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">提取器是用来打破硬地表面的处理时间很长的工具。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">砕ける</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">くだける</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n2\" href=\"../../n2/vocab/\">N2</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">动词Ⅱ</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">動詞Ⅱ</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">破碎；碎裂；粉碎；崩溃；瓦解；衰退；减退（如热情）；消沉（如斗志）；变得不拘礼节；打破拘谨；变得随和；变得浅显易懂；通俗化；感到担忧；感到不安</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"224119\">コップが<ruby>地面<rp>(</rp><rt>じめん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>に<ruby>落<rp>(</rp><rt>お</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>ちて<ruby>砕<rp>(</rp><rt>くだ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>けた。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">玻璃坠毁在地上。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">くだらない</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\"></span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n2\" href=\"../../n2/vocab/\">N2</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">い形容词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">い形容詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">琐碎；微不足道；无足轻重；不值一提；无价值；无用；没出息；愚蠢；荒唐；荒诞；愚昧；幼稚</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"225678\">くだらない<ruby>話<rp>(</rp><rt>はなし</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>はもうたくさんだ。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">我们听够了空话。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">下る</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">くだる</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n2\" href=\"../../n2/vocab/\">N2</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">动词Ⅰ</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">動詞Ⅰ</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">下降；下来；（命令、判决等）下达；宣判；流逝；经过（时间）；投降；屈服；少于；低于；不如；逊于（多用否定形）；腹泻；拉肚子；随粪便排出；从体内排出；贬低自己；谦逊</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"169405\"><ruby>山<rp>(</rp><rt>やま</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>を<ruby>下<rp>(</rp><rt>くだ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>ったところに<ruby>学校<rp>(</rp><rt>がっこう</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>がある。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">山下有一所学校</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">唇</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">くちびる</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n2\" href=\"../../n2/vocab/\">N2</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">唇；嘴唇</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"124348\"><ruby>冬<rp>(</rp><rt>ふゆ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>は<ruby>唇<rp>(</rp><rt>くちびる</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>があれます。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">冬季嘴唇干裂。 <a class=\"ex-attribution\" href=\"https://tatoeba.org/sentences/show/2032248\" title=\"Tatoeba · ydcok\" aria-label=\"Tatoeba · ydcok\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">↗</a></span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">口紅</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">くちべに</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n2\" href=\"../../n2/vocab/\">N2</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">口红</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"197116\">ブライアンはケイトのために<ruby>口紅<rp>(</rp><rt>くちべに</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>を<ruby>買<rp>(</rp><rt>か</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>った。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">布莱恩为凯特买了口红</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">くっつく</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\"></span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n2\" href=\"../../n2/vocab/\">N2</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">动词Ⅰ</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">動詞Ⅰ</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">粘附；附着；紧贴；紧跟着；靠近；紧挨着；与…有牵连；跟…亲近；与…打得火热</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"172964\"><ruby>骨<rp>(</rp><rt>ほね</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>がくっつけば、ギプスは<ruby>取<rp>(</rp><rt>と</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>られます。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">骨架放好后,石膏就会被移走</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">くっつける</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\"></span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n2\" href=\"../../n2/vocab/\">N2</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">动词Ⅱ</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">動詞Ⅱ</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">粘上；贴上；接上；并排放；靠近；撮合（婚姻）；使（两人）结婚</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"112458\"><ruby>彼<rp>(</rp><rt>かれ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>はその<ruby>破片<rp>(</rp><rt>はへん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>をくっつけ<ruby>合<rp>(</rp><rt>あ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>わした。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">他把破碎的碎片粘在一起了</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\