)</rp></ruby>です。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">这是我自己的计划</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">区分</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">くぶん</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n2\" href=\"../../n2/vocab/\">N2</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">划分；区分；分界；分隔；分段；隔间；（交通）车道；分类；归类；分组；分段；（逻辑）划分（把概念的外延分成下位概念）</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"3232021\"><ruby>土地<rp>(</rp><rt>とち</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>は８つに<ruby>区分<rp>(</rp><rt>くぶん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>された。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">土地被分成8块</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">組合せ</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">くみあわせ</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n2\" href=\"../../n2/vocab/\">N2</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">组合；搭配；套装；配对；对阵；配组；（数学）组合（不计顺序的选取）</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"></div></li>"]